        "id": 210541,
        "name": "speedyolrac",
        "username": "speedyolrac",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-09T13:04:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dprcooke\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dprcooke/48/1961_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dprcooke:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>. . .&nbsp; Basically, just go with whatever is  most fun  for your players.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah that.</p>\n<p>I usually just have them tell me a story on what happened. They usually&nbsp;say things that happened&nbsp;between session; some training they did, Some info the lifted from the last raid on the mob's place. I had one player state that in her 2nd issue (origins&nbsp;territory) she got into a fight with Fanatic (She has Demon fulled powers) and Fanatic been after her since then (To make her recurring, it is the player's favorite hero). I had a person say that in their solo book they continued working with the police to create a Swat type task force for powered villains&nbsp; (gave gadgets they stole for E.Vile Corp.)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
